# Curated unnamed individuals: people who act in a biblical narrative but are never given a personal name.
# Scope: individuals in narrative accounts only. Parable characters (Good Samaritan, prodigal son, rich man and
# Lazarus) and groups (Magi, shepherds, the ten lepers) are left out.
# Each entry: id, name (used as first_name and display_name), gender, testament, ref (first reference),
# passages (verse ranges the person appears in; summed for verse_count), summary.
# Loaded by gen_unnamed.py -> initdb/03_unnamed.sql, which runs after 02_data.sql.
# All references were checked against the KJV text (Theographic verses.json) on 2026-10-29.

